{"script":"Main_0_05_5","des":"见习铁匠达特","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"charaName":"见习铁匠达特","text":"[show]啊。我是达特。你们就是茜塔介绍的荒野客？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"见习铁匠达特","text":"[show]啊……喔。既是荒野客也是契约者。没差。[r]反正要不是欠她酒钱，我才懒得做这档子费力不讨好的事。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"见习铁匠达特","text":"[show]总之，给我看看那些……呃，铁片。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"见习铁匠达特","text":"[show]……嗯。没错。我猜得很对，这些是哈萨琳时期驿站配给卫兵们的上好装备……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"见习铁匠达特","text":"[show]被魔物吃掉以后变成的垃圾。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"见习铁匠达特","text":"[show]嗯……至少你能挥得动锤子，是吧？[r]带我到你们的营地去，我会教给你们把这些垃圾变废为宝的方法。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":0,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-331.5,"scaleX":1.5,"y":-187.5,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":0.4,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-331.5,"scaleX":1.5,"y":-187.5,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":0,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":700,"scaleX":0.9,"y":-264.80000000000007,"scaleY":0.9,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":700,"scaleX":0.9,"y":-264.80000000000007,"scaleY":0.9,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"bright":0.6,"alpha":0,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":67,"scaleX":1,"y"